<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>YOURS</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PRYVT</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">YOURS</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">048svkfPfoHqQ3Uzy4ECDP</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.015" end="00:25.277">I been doing just fine, rather happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.277" end="00:28.152">Don't know what it feel like, no one's stopping me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.152" end="00:32.750">Saying that I moved on but if I'm being honest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.750" end="00:34.758">I'm stuck here, tireless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.758" end="00:37.772">어제부터 오늘도 내일까지만</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.772" end="00:41.788">너부터 우리의 마지막일 때까지</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.788" end="00:45.614">시간이 멈춰있어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.614" end="00:48.375">Hope you been like me too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.375" end="00:51.142">I just missed the times with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.142" end="00:56.174">It's more than memories that are stuck with me of us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.174" end="01:01.850">'Cause I just wanna know, if you would ever go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.850" end="01:08.876">Reminiscing 'bout everything, about everything it was</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.876" end="01:11.635">Hope you been like me too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.635" end="01:14.398">I just missed the times with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.398" end="01:19.445">It's more than memories that are stuck with me of us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.445" end="01:25.480">'Cause I just wanna know, if you would ever go (Go)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.480" end="01:33.480">Reminiscing 'bout everything, about everything it was</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.297" end="02:04.297">누군가를 믿을 때마다 널 생각했던 게 당연했어 이젠</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.957" end="02:12.496">뭔가 이상해 이러면 안 되는데</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.496" end="02:18.016">No, I'm still calling your name (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.016" end="02:23.539">You made me laugh when my days were bad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.539" end="02:26.295">And the world felt so distant</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.295" end="02:29.306">But I tried to be me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.306" end="02:32.066">You held me so tight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.066" end="02:35.077">My heart felt a light</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.077" end="02:41.604">I pray that this moment will last (Last)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.604" end="02:44.612">Hope you been like me too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.612" end="02:47.667">I just missed the times with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.667" end="02:52.686">It's more than memories that are stuck with me of us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.686" end="02:58.707">'Cause I just wanna know, if you would ever go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.707" end="03:06.238">Reminiscing 'bout everything, about everything it was</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.238" end="03:08.252">Hope you been like me too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.252" end="03:11.012">I just missed the times with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.012" end="03:15.782">It's more than memories that are stuck with me of us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.782" end="03:21.553">'Cause I just wanna know, if you would ever go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.553" end="03:29.553">Reminiscing 'bout everything, about everything it was</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:35.108" end="03:42.142">And I don't know, I don't know, if this is the truth (Oh-woah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:42.142" end="03:45.400">I just miss you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:45.400" end="03:51.726">Reminiscing 'bout everything, about everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:51.726" end="03:55.726">Do you?</p></div></body></tt>